            Group userTab
              {
                label {User}
                comment {Wired for real: `fluid.node_browser`'s own `labelColor`/`labelFont`/`classColor`/
`classFont`/`funcColor`/`funcFont`/`nameColor`/`nameFont`/`codeColor`/
`codeFont`/`commentColor`/`commentFont` are real module-level fields,
with FLTK's real static defaults (not guessed -- traced from
`Node_Browser.cxx` directly, including confirming `labelColor = 72`
really is a deliberate dark-red accent color, not a placeholder
number). Every row below edits its own field for real: font (a
`Choice` over the same real 16-font list `widget_panel.d`'s own Style
tab already uses) and color (a swatch `Button` opening `fl.show_
colormap.showColormap()`, matching FLTK's own `cb_Color_Chip`).
Label/Class/Name/Comments are genuinely consulted by `NodeBrowserItem.
drawItemContent()` already and change the live tree's own rendering
immediately; Function/Code are real, edited, persisted fields too, but
`drawItemContent()` doesn't distinguish those two row *kinds* from an
ordinary widget/class row yet (a separate, larger gap -- see `fluid.
node_browser`'s own top comment), so editing them has no visible
effect on the tree until that lands.

The small `MenuButton` next to each swatch is wired too,
matching FLTK's own
`colormenu[]`/`cb_Color_Choice()` (`widget_panel_callbacks.cxx`/
`settings_panel.cxx`): a 14-item quick-pick popup (Foreground/
Background/Background 2/Selection/Inactive Color, Black, White, Gray
0, Dark 3-1, Light 1-3 -- FLTK's exact list and divider placement)
on each of the 6 rows, applying the chosen `Fl_Color` via the new
`fluid.node_browser.applyPresetColor()` helper (updates the field, the
swatch, persists via `savePrefs()`) plus the same conditional
live-tree redraw each row's own swatch-button callback already does.}
                xywh {10 60 340 480}
                scale_image {36 24}
                image {pixmaps/user_circle_64.png}
                compress_image 1
                hide
              }
              {
                Box {}
                  {
                    label {---- Widget Browser ----}
                    xywh {110 84 220 20}
                    labelfont 1
                    labelsize 12
                    align 20
                  }
                Group {}
                  {
                    label {Label:}
                    xywh {110 112 230 20}
                    labelfont 1
                    labelsize 12
                    align 4
                  }
                  {
                    Choice userLabelFontChoice
                      {
                        callback {labelFont = cast(Font) userLabelFontChoice.value();
auto b = browser(); if (b !is null) b.redraw();
savePrefs();}
                        xywh {110 112 161 20}
                        box THIN_UP_BOX
                        down_box BORDER_BOX
                        labelfont 1
                        labelsize 12
                        textsize 11
                        setup {o.value(cast(int) labelFont);}
                        resizable
                        uses_font_menu
                      }
                      {
                      }
                    Button userLabelColorButton
                      {
                        callback {pickColor(labelColor, userLabelColorButton);
auto b = browser(); if (b !is null) b.redraw();}
                        xywh {271 112 51 20}
                        labelsize 12
                        setup {o.color(labelColor);}
                      }
                    MenuButton {}
                      {
                        callback {int idx = o.value();
if (idx < 0 || idx >= colorMenuValues.length) return;
applyPresetColor(labelColor, colorMenuValues[idx], userLabelColorButton);
